CORE
main.c
--havoc-loops
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line 7 the loop runs three times: FAILURE$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line 8 the loop does not change x: FAILURE$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line 9 the loop does not change y: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
